of development, and the other is a movement

9
00:01:06.119 --> 00:01:13.169
linked to respiration, and which will generate movements, and the other is a movement further attributed to motoricity.

10
00:01:13.759 --> 00:01:21.249
You see, one must clearly differentiate. When I move like this, it is very different from this movement at the level of my liver.

11
00:01:21.339 --> 00:01:30.139
So, if I want to rework a tissue, I restore it to its motility, and its functional strength, its functional strength is there, you see, that's where

12
